msgstr ""

#: manual/diagnostics.md:27
msgid "Times are inclusive: a method that calls others includes them. The profiler adds a little overhead, so leave it off for normal play. It never lets a failure reach the game: if it cannot attach to a method, it skips it, and if it cannot start, it removes everything it attached."
